KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
WAEC - Mathematics (Year 2024)

Q1. If 2^(x+1) + 2^x = 24, find the value of x.
  (A) 2
  (B) 3
  (C) 4
  (D) 5
  Answer: B - Factor out 2^x: 2^x(2 + 1) = 24 => 2^x(3) = 24 => 2^x = 8 => x = 3.

Q2. Evaluate log10(25) + log10(4) - log10(10).
  (A) 1
  (B) 2
  (C) 10
  (D) 100
  Answer: A - Using log laws: log10((25*4)/10) = log10(100/10) = log10(10) = 1.


